**Given:**

frac{2²k⁺¹ - 2^k times 2k⁺²}{2^k times 2k⁺³ - 2² times 2²k}

**Formula used:**

am × aⁿ = am⁺ⁿ

**Calculation:**

frac{2²k⁺¹ - 2k⁺k⁺²}{2k⁺k⁺³ - 2²⁺²k}

⇒ frac{2²k⁺¹ - 2²k⁺²}{2²k⁺³ - 2²k⁺²}

⇒ frac{2²k times (2¹ - 2²)}{2²k times (2³ - 2²)}

⇒ (2 - 4)/(8 - 4)

⇒ (-2)/(4)

⇒ -(1)/(2)

**∴ The correct answer is option (3).**

Given:

sqrt[6]{4096} +sqrt[4]{4096}+sqrt[3]{4096}+ sqrt{4096}

Calculation:

sqrt[6]{4096} +sqrt[4]{4096}+sqrt[3]{4096}+ sqrt{4096}

⇒ sqrt[6]{2¹²} + sqrt[4]{2¹²} + sqrt[3]{2¹²} + sqrt{2¹²} 

⇒ 2¹² over ⁶ + 2¹² over ⁴ + 2¹² over ³ + 2¹² over ² 

⇒ 2² + 2³ + 2⁴ + 2⁶

⇒ 4 + 8 + 16 + 64

⇒ 92

∴ The simplified value of sqrt[6]{4096} +sqrt[4]{4096}+sqrt[3]{4096}+ sqrt{4096} is 92.
